review(2197,[tarzan,tarzanchase,tarzanofficial],'The predator pursuit leading to Dark Mountain is Sabor leopard.', ['Sabor is identified as the pursuing leopard.','Kerchak is the troop leader, not this predator.','Zugor is a gorilla pretending to be a monster whose call scares the leopard off.','Kago is a gorilla encountered after the pursuit, not the pursuing leopard.'],'Fixed scene order excludes the gorillas who threaten Tarzan later; the predator is not Zugor despite the frightening roar.','Tarzan II (2005), post-departure pursuit.','1338 asks Sabor killing Tarzan parents in the original film, not this pursuit.')
